#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:2
msgid "Instance Tabs"
msgstr "Instancia Tabs"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:4
msgid "Customize the UI for your Instances by providing your own tabs."
msgstr "Customize el UI para su Instancias por providing su own tabs."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:7
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "Setup"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:8
msgid ""
"Create a new class that extends "
"``com.morpheusdata.core.AbstractInstanceTabProvider``. When the Morpheus UI "
"builds the Instance UI it calls the ``renderTemplate`` method. Below is a "
"simple example binding the Instance object to the template model."
msgstr ""
"Crear a nuevo class ese extends "
"``com.morpheusdata.core.AbstractInstanceTabProvider``. Cuando el Morpheus UI"
" builds el Instancia UI ello calls el ``renderTemplate`` method. Below es a "
"simple ejemplo binding el Instancia object a el template model."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:10
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"@Override\n"
"HTMLResponse renderTemplate(Instance instance) {\n"
"  ViewModel<String> model = new ViewModel<String>()\n"
"  model.object = instance\n"
"  getRenderer().renderTemplate(\"hbs/instanceTab\", model)\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"@Override\n"
"HTMLResponse renderTemplate(Instancia instancia) {\n"
" ViewModel<String> model = nuevo ViewModel<String>()\n"
" model.object = instancia\n"
" getRenderer().renderTemplate(\"hbs/instanciaTab\", model)\n"
"}"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:20
msgid ""
"Use ``MorpheusContext.buildInstanceConfig`` to get more details about your "
"Instance. See ``com.morpheusdata.model.TaskConfig``"
msgstr ""
"Usar ``MorpheusContext.buildInstanceConfig`` a get más detalles acerca de su"
" Instancia. See ``com.morpheusdata.model.TaskConfig``"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:22
msgid ""
"Handlebars <https://github.com/jknack/handlebars.java> is the default "
"provided template engine. To override this default, implement the "
"``com.morpheusdata.core.InstanceTabProvider`` interface and then write your "
"own ``getRenderer()`` method."
msgstr ""
"Handlebars <https://github.com/jknack/handlebars.java> es el predeterminado "
"provided template engine. Un override este predeterminado, implement el "
"``com.morpheusdata.core.InstanceTabProvider`` interface y then write su own "
"``getRenderer()`` method."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:26
msgid "Templating"
msgstr "Templating"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:27
msgid ""
"See the Views <https://github.com/gomorpheus/morpheus-plugin-"
"core/blob/master/morpheus-plugin-docs/src/docs/asciidoc/Views.adoc> section "
"and the documentation for your templating engine for specific syntax."
msgstr ""
"Consulte la Views <https://github.com/gomorpheus/morpheus-plugin-"
"core/blob/master/morpheus-plugin-docs/src/docs/asciidoc/Views.adoc> sección "
"y el documentation para su templating engine para específico syntax."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:31
msgid "Security Policies"
msgstr "Seguridad Políticas"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:34
msgid "User Permissions"
msgstr "Usuario Permisos"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:35
msgid ""
"Before a template is rendered in the UI, the ``InstanceTabProvider.show`` "
"method is called to determine if the current user can view the custom "
"Instance Tab. For example, you may wish to check that the current ``User`` "
"has been granted the custom permission defined by your plugin."
msgstr ""
"Antes de a template es rendered en el UI, el ``InstanceTabProvider.show`` "
"method es llamado a determine si el actual usuario puede view el "
"personalizado Instancia Pestaña. Por ejemplo, usted puede wish a check ese "
"el actual ``User`` ha sido granted el personalizado permiso defined por su "
"plugin."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:37
msgid ""
"@Override\n"
"Boolean show(Instance instance, User user, Account account) {\n"
"  def show = true\n"
"  plugin.permissions.each { Permission permission ->\n"
"    if(user.permissions[permission.code] != permission.availableAccessTypes.last().toString()){\n"
"      show = false\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"  return show\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"@Override\n"
"Boolean show(Instancia instancia, Usuario usuario, Cuenta cuenta) {\n"
" def show = true\n"
" plugin.permisos.cada { Permiso permiso ->\n"
" si(usuario.permisos[permiso.code] != permiso.availableAccessTypes.last().toString()){\n"
" show = false\n"
" }\n"
" }\n"
" return show\n"
"}"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:52
msgid "Content Security Policy"
msgstr "Content Seguridad Política"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:53
msgid ""
"If your custom UI needs to include external resources such as scripts, "
"stylesheets, or frames, you will need to customize the Morpheus ``Content-"
"Security-Policy`` Header to allow those elements to be loaded in the "
"browser."
msgstr ""
"Si su personalizado UI needs a include external recursos como scripts, "
"stylesheets, o frames, usted va a need a customize el Morpheus ``Content-"
"Security-Policy`` Header a permitir esos elements a be loaded en el browser."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:55
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"@Override\n"
"TabContentSecurityPolicy getContentSecurityPolicy() {\n"
"  def csp = new TabContentSecurityPolicy()\n"
"  csp.scriptSrc = '*.jsdelivr.net'\n"
"  csp.frameSrc = '*.digitalocean.com'\n"
"  csp.imgSrc = '*.wikimedia.org'\n"
"  csp.styleSrc = 'https: *.bootstrapcdn.com'\n"
"  csp\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"@Override\n"
"TabContentSeguridadPolítica getContentSeguridadPolítica() {\n"
" def csp = nuevo TabContentSeguridadPolítica()\n"
" csp.scriptSrc = '*.jsdelivr.net'\n"
" csp.frameSrc = '*.digitalocean.com'\n"
" csp.imgSrc = '*.wikimedia.org'\n"
" csp.styleSrc = 'https: *.bootstrapcdn.com'\n"
" csp\n"
"}"
